    <http://example.org/node/chunk115> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The City of Belval expects a solution that provides intelligent assistance to agents, facilitates access to information, improves answer quality, and reduces processing times." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk116> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "How can we leverage we AI capabilities to meet expects while ensuring explicability, transparency, and compliance with regulatory requirements?" ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk117> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To address The City of Belval expectations, we can leverage our AI capabilities in several ways." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk118> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "First, we can utilize we large language models (LLMs) expertise, particularly we preferred sovereign model, Mistral 7B Instruct, which is self-hostable and has strong French-language performance. our preferred sovereign model, Mistral 7B Instruct, which is self-hostable and has strong French-language performance can be fine-tuned using we fine-tuning methods such as LoRA or QLoRA to adapt to the specific tone and format of the administrative documents. we Retrieval-Augmented Generation (RAG) capabilities can facilitate access to information by providing relevant and up-to-date content to agents, thereby improving answer quality. we have experience with various retrieval strategies, including dense vector semantic search and BM25 sparse search, which can be integrated into we solution." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk119> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To ensure explicability and transparency, we can implement we Explainable AI (XAI) methods, such as source citation, chain-of-thought display, SHAP for classification models, or LIME." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk12> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To this title: the data will have to be hosted exclusively on the territory of the European Union, no transfer of data outside the European Union will be authorized, the data will have to be protected in an appropriate manner (encryption, anonymization if necessary). 4.2 Explicability and transparency the local authority expects that the recommendations or proposals issued by The expected solution can be explained." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk120> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "These methods will enable we to provide explanations for the recommendations or proposals issued by our solution, which is essential for building trust in the system." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk121> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Regarding compliance with regulatory requirements, our solution will be designed to respect the General Data Protection Regulation (GDPR) and ensure data sovereignty. we have experience with quarterly bias testing processes on demographically diverse test sets, which can help identify and mitigate potential biases in the system." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk122> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "By combining these AI capabilities, we can develop an intelligent assistance tool that meets The City of Belval expectations while ensuring explicability, transparency, and compliance with regulatory requirements. our solution will be designed to provide high-quality answers, facilitate access to information, reduce processing times, and support the agents in the agents daily missions." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk123> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "As part of the City of Belval's policy of sustainable development, the solution must contribute to reducing energetic consumption and rely on infrastructures with low carbon impact." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message15> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk124> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "What strategies can we implement to minimize we environmental footprint while delivering a high-quality solution that meets the client's needs?" ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message15> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk125> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To minimize we environmental footprint while delivering a high-quality solution to the City of Belval's, we can implement several strategies that align with we company capabilities and the client's requirements." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message15> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk126> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Firstly, we can leverage we green hosting partners, such as OVHcloud or Scaleway, both located in France and utilizing 100% renewable energy. leverage directly supports the goal of relying on infrastructures with low carbon impact." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message15> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk127> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Secondly, we can apply digital sobriety practices that reduce energy consumption." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message15> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk128> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "For instance, we can implement INT8/INT4 model quantisation to reduce GPU energy by approximately 40%, auto-scaling to zero outside business hours to minimize idle resource usage, and query result caching to decrease recomputation needs by an estimated 20%." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message15> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk129> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Additionally, adopting a green IT hardware procurement policy with a minimum 5-year lifecycle for we equipment can further contribute to sustainability." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message15> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk13> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "It will have to be possible, a posteriori, to understand the elements having led to an answer or a suggestion. 4.3 Responsibility The expected solution will have to be designed as a tool of assistance." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk130> a prov:Entity ;
