    <http://example.org/node/chunk142> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Our are committed to reducing energetic consumption and minimizing environmental footprint." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message16> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk143> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Our strategy includes leveraging green hosting, adopting a green IT hardware procurement policy, and utilizing model quantization to reduce GPU energy consumption. # Understanding of Requirements The City of Belval requires an intelligent assistance tool that integrates with existing systems of information, provides response times compatible with daily use by agents (less than 2 seconds), and guarantees a high level of availability (99.9%). an artificial intelligence (AI) solution that will assist municipal agents in their daily tasks must comply with regulatory requirements, including the General Data Protection Regulation (GDPR) and the EU AI Act." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message16> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk144> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The City of Belval expects an artificial intelligence (AI) solution that will assist municipal agents in their daily tasks to facilitate access to information, improve the quality of answers, and reduce processing times. an artificial intelligence (AI) solution that will assist municipal agents in their daily tasks will provide intelligent assistance to agents in agents daily missions, supporting agents in tasks such as searching for information, drafting letters or answers, and instructing files. # Proposed Solution an artificial intelligence (AI) solution that will assist municipal agents in their daily tasks will be based on the following components: 1. **Technical Architecture**: Our technical architecture will be based on AI/ML systems, cloud architecture, API integration, data engineering, and cybersecurity." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message16> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk145> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Our will utilize large language models (LLMs), specifically Mistral 7B and LLaMA 3, to provide intelligent assistance to agents. 2. **Deployment**: Our will deploy an artificial intelligence (AI) solution that will assist municipal agents in their daily tasks on a low-carbon-impact infrastructure, utilizing green hosting partners such as Scaleway and OVHCloud. deploy will be based on Docker, Kubernetes (K8s), and Helm. 3. **Security and Compliance**: an artificial intelligence (AI) solution that will assist municipal agents in their daily tasks will comply with regulatory requirements, including the General Data Protection Regulation (GDPR) and the EU AI Act." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message16> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk146> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Our security measures will include encryption, anonymization, and access controls. 4. **Exploitation Cost**: Our exploitation cost will be based on a combination of fixed and variable costs." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message16> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk147> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Our target gross margin percentage is 28%, and Our minimum acceptable margin percentage is 18%." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message16> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk148> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Our will ensure that the exploitation cost of an artificial intelligence (AI) solution that will assist municipal agents in their daily tasks remains mastered and compatible with The City of Belval budgetary capacities. 5. **Environmental Sustainability**: Our strategy includes leveraging green hosting, adopting a green IT hardware procurement policy, and utilizing model quantization to reduce GPU energy consumption." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message16> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk149> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Our aim to achieve a 35% reduction in energy usage compared to baseline. an artificial intelligence (AI) solution that will assist municipal agents in their daily tasks will be delivered within an estimated project duration of 18 months, with a total budget of €3,000,000. # Unaddressed Requirements None of the requirements from the tender are unaddressed in this proposal. # Conclusion In conclusion, Our consortium, comprising specialized agents with expertise in various domains is confident that an artificial intelligence (AI) solution that will assist municipal agents in their daily tasks meets the requirements and expectations of The City of Belval. an artificial intelligence (AI) solution that will assist municipal agents in their daily tasks leverages large language models to provide intelligent assistance to agents, while ensuring compliance with regulatory requirements and minimizing environmental footprint." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message16> .

